TO ALL WHOM IT MAY CONCERN, I, Smt. A, widow of X of ………… SEND GREETINGS.

WHEREAS I was married with X on………… 	at and a sum of Re …………. (Rupees ..............................	only) was fixed as dower at the time of the marriage.
 
AND WHEREAS the said X has expired on …………intestate leaving some property and B, C and D the only sons and legal heirs under the Muslim law
 
